ps:icon","size":18}]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"UIDAI processes the request; it often takes a few days but can take longer. Track it with your URN."}]]}]]}]]}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can NISE COMPORT change my Aadhaar mobile number?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"We guide you to the correct official route and help you prepare. The update itself is done by UIDAI through its authorised centres or its own online services.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Should I share my Aadhaar OTP with anyone?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. Enter OTPs yourself only in a process you started on an official UIDAI channel. Staff should never ask for your OTP.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How long does the update take?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"UIDAI processes the request; it often takes a few days but can take longer. Track it with your URN.\"}}]}"}}]]}]
